FULL ALPHA MECHANISM SHIFT TABLE
All values verified (H_ocf == H_ref for all n).
Generated: kind-pasteur-2026-04-16

Method: cycle_cc (canonical DP) + SOS + iterated SSC (Björklund subset sum convolution)
SSC runtime: O(k_max * n^2 * 2^n) per tournament.
  n=17 kmax=5: ~22s, n=19 kmax=6: ~137s

