=== TERM DOMINANCE ORDER ===
(which 2^k * α_k term is largest?)
n=3..9:   α₁ > α₂ > α₃    (α₁-dominant)
n=11..17: α₂ > α₁ > α₃    (α₂-dominant, α₁ second)
n=19:     α₂ > α₃ > α₁    (α₂-dominant, α₃ OVERTAKES α₁!)

The SECOND CROSSOVER: 2α₁ vs 8α₃ cross at n≈17-19.
  n=17: 2α₁=3.30B, 8α₃=3.66B → α₃ already larger than α₁!
  n=19: 2α₁=252.9B, 8α₃=343.7B → α₃/α₁ = 0.340

The FIRST CROSSOVER: 2α₁ vs 4α₂ cross at n≈10.

